@base = http://localhost:4004/tracking
@id = d3b0a1e2-0003-4000-8000-000000000003

### All trackings with their log
GET {{base}}/OrderTracking?$expand=statusLog

### Create a tracking (use a real order number that isn't tracked yet)
POST {{base}}/OrderTracking
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salesOrder": "4", "customer": "17100001", "plannedDate": "2026-12-15" }

### Create with an unknown order: should fail with ORDER_NOT_FOUND
POST {{base}}/OrderTracking
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salesOrder": "999999999", "plannedDate": "2026-12-15" }

### Recalculate the status from S/4HANA
POST {{base}}/OrderTracking(ID={{id}},IsActiveEntity=true)/TrackingService.refreshStatus
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Report a delay
POST {{base}}/OrderTracking({{id}})/TrackingService.markDelayed
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Spedition streikt" }

### German messages: same call without a reason
POST {{base}}/OrderTracking({{id}})/TrackingService.markDelayed
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: de

{ "reason": "" }

### Notify the customer
POST {{base}}/OrderTracking({{id}})/TrackingService.notifyCustomer
Content-Type: application/json

{}